WEBVTT

00:08.500 --> 00:09.770
Let the girl go!

00:32.300 --> 00:34.260
Teacher, why?

00:34.260 --> 00:38.430
Too bad. I guess those girls failed.

00:43.470 --> 00:46.600
Miss Sumeragi, I'll tell you this.

00:47.340 --> 00:49.900
You should not trust others.

00:52.180 --> 00:54.650
I hate those kinds of things!

00:58.890 --> 00:59.750
Really?

01:41.530 --> 01:43.230
It seems like it failed.

01:46.070 --> 01:49.270
I have a general idea from listening in.

01:49.810 --> 01:52.100
I encountered unexpected interference.

01:52.580 --> 01:54.540
Don't worry.

01:54.540 --> 01:56.580
I feel thankful for the fact that

01:56.580 --> 02:00.720
she has friends who will risk their lives to protect her.

02:00.720 --> 02:02.890
But at this rate...

02:02.890 --> 02:04.820
I will try to attack again.

02:05.420 --> 02:07.760
Got it. I am counting on you.

02:07.760 --> 02:08.850
Roger.

02:37.790 --> 02:45.590
Holding the rising sun to my heart

02:45.590 --> 02:51.160
I look far into the distant sky

02:52.570 --> 03:02.570
When I closed my eyes, a nostalgic wind blew between the memories

03:06.820 --> 03:16.820
Even if your painfully shiny smile is filled with tears, I'll live on

03:24.830 --> 03:32.170
We were born into a time where we can't go back

03:32.170 --> 03:39.620
No matter what awaits in the future that quickly passes by

03:39.620 --> 03:46.960
We'll walk on by trusting the endless love

03:46.960 --> 03:54.630
And tightly holding onto my own feelings alone

03:58.400 --> 04:03.240
Peach Peach Beach

04:27.430 --> 04:28.900
Sick Bay

04:38.270 --> 04:39.170
Look.

04:40.380 --> 04:43.140
These things stuck between their cervical and sacral vertebrae...

04:44.050 --> 04:46.880
I think that's how they were controlling them.

04:50.890 --> 04:52.790
That's what I already said.

04:55.320 --> 04:56.930
According to last night's events,

04:56.930 --> 04:59.950
we can conclude that they were attached by Ms. Risako.

05:00.330 --> 05:02.360
I said that too, you know.

05:02.360 --> 05:04.730
Don't butt in every time!

05:04.730 --> 05:08.540
It's because you say things as if you came up with them.

05:08.540 --> 05:10.240
I thought about it too!

05:10.240 --> 05:12.440
Not! You said, "How gross," and held back.

05:12.440 --> 05:14.680
I thought it was gross, but was still thinking.

05:12.840 --> 05:14.680
Cut it out already.

05:14.680 --> 05:15.880
Liar!

05:15.480 --> 05:16.550
I'm not lying!

05:16.550 --> 05:17.780
It's a lie.

05:17.380 --> 05:18.710
It's the truth!

05:20.050 --> 05:21.310
Karen...

05:28.460 --> 05:31.990
This device will go away by itself after a few days.

05:31.990 --> 05:33.030
What?

05:33.030 --> 05:35.560
There are no after-effects, so you don't need to worry.

05:35.560 --> 05:37.670
How do you know that?

05:37.670 --> 05:40.100
Have you seen them before?

05:40.100 --> 05:41.540
Where did you see them?

05:43.070 --> 05:47.540
I feel that this device will go away after a few days.

05:47.540 --> 05:49.210
She changed the wording.

05:50.250 --> 05:51.840
I'll go on ahead.

06:01.390 --> 06:03.260
Who is she?

06:03.260 --> 06:04.430
Our senior.

06:04.430 --> 06:06.300
That's not what I meant.

06:06.300 --> 06:07.890
We're near our target location.

06:15.200 --> 06:16.260
There it is.

06:18.610 --> 06:22.100
Destination sighted.
Treasure Hunting Club, assemble!

06:27.180 --> 06:28.580
Everyone...

06:28.580 --> 06:33.920
We overcame many obstacles and were able to reach our destination!

06:34.220 --> 06:35.320
Congratulations!

06:35.320 --> 06:37.430
Congratulations!

06:37.430 --> 06:39.960
This club really is weird.

06:39.960 --> 06:43.870
Plus, there was only one obstacle last night.

06:43.870 --> 06:45.940
Hey, you, no mumbling.

06:45.940 --> 06:47.240
Yes, ma'am.

06:47.240 --> 06:52.140
The real adventure starts here, so don't slack off.

06:52.140 --> 06:53.640
Yes, leader!

06:53.640 --> 06:54.800
They've been totally slacking off.

06:55.780 --> 06:58.210
Yes, yes, shutting up.

06:58.210 --> 07:03.450
Then, in order to strengthen our teamwork for the adventure,

07:03.450 --> 07:06.180
we're going to have a beach party!

07:08.220 --> 07:14.420
Everyone, please relax, have a drink, and raise your spirits!

07:23.570 --> 07:25.840
I've delivered all the food.

07:25.840 --> 07:27.080
Good work.

07:27.080 --> 07:30.380
You stay with the girls.

07:30.380 --> 07:32.780
Something strange might happen again.

07:32.780 --> 07:34.020
Understood, sir.

07:34.020 --> 07:35.750
What about you, Captain?

07:36.190 --> 07:38.750
I am going to investigate the sea bed in advance.

07:38.750 --> 07:41.350
I see. Understood.

07:46.200 --> 07:47.160
Wait up!

08:01.580 --> 08:04.310
150 yards, 4 inches from the pin.

08:04.310 --> 08:07.550
Pretty good. But why golf?

08:07.550 --> 08:10.120
Karen's a little strange.

08:10.120 --> 08:13.420
It seems like she lost her past memories.

08:13.420 --> 08:15.320
Amnesia?

08:15.320 --> 08:18.190
Not being able to remember anything is a problem...

08:21.430 --> 08:23.630
Here he comes. Gusto!

08:23.630 --> 08:25.030
I'm hungry!

08:25.030 --> 08:26.900
Yes, yes, I'll be right there.

08:44.120 --> 08:45.350
Good, good.

08:45.350 --> 08:47.860
Delicious! Great!

08:47.860 --> 08:50.220
There's still a lot more, so please eat up!

08:51.290 --> 08:52.930
Looks like they're having fun.

08:52.930 --> 08:54.590
That's great.

08:55.030 --> 08:58.900
Hey, does everyone know about last night's incident?

08:59.200 --> 09:02.070
Of course. They were knocked out.

09:02.070 --> 09:03.240
Why?

09:03.240 --> 09:07.810
No one's worried about the girls who are comatose on the ship.

09:07.810 --> 09:09.610
Because it's an adventure.

09:09.610 --> 09:12.610
No one's asked about the incident either.

09:12.610 --> 09:14.450
Because it's an adventure.

09:14.450 --> 09:15.780
Adventure?

09:15.780 --> 09:18.920
It's normal to encounter danger once or twice.

09:18.920 --> 09:20.180
What are you talking about?

09:20.660 --> 09:22.990
I guess that's true...

09:24.730 --> 09:26.130
Well, whatever.

09:26.560 --> 09:28.330
Gusto, grill some vegetables.

09:28.330 --> 09:29.200
Yes, yes.

09:29.200 --> 09:30.400
Grill the meat.

09:30.400 --> 09:31.670
Comin' right up!

09:31.670 --> 09:32.800
Put sauce on.

09:32.800 --> 09:33.700
Okay!

09:33.700 --> 09:34.900
Put some love into it!

09:34.900 --> 09:36.370
What the heck is that?

09:36.370 --> 09:37.570
Please grill this.

09:37.570 --> 09:38.870
My pleasure...

09:40.310 --> 09:44.940
Where did you get that coconut crab? Can we eat it?

09:46.250 --> 09:50.450
It will be fine if it gets red.
It has poison if it turns green.

09:50.120 --> 09:51.420
Seems to be true...

09:52.860 --> 09:54.980
Your grilled crab, milady.

09:56.230 --> 09:58.990
Wow! Thanks for the meal.

10:04.400 --> 10:05.800
Poison from the crab?

10:09.710 --> 10:10.770
What?

10:10.770 --> 10:11.830
Aika?

10:18.880 --> 10:20.210
This isn't good!

10:25.490 --> 10:27.390
Get down, everyone!

10:30.890 --> 10:32.160
This is...

10:32.160 --> 10:33.390
Eri!

10:33.800 --> 10:35.830
Why can't you land correctly?

10:35.830 --> 10:37.900
Karen! Gusto!

10:37.900 --> 10:39.000
I'm okay.

10:39.000 --> 10:40.540
All right so far.

10:40.540 --> 10:42.470
Gusto, hand me my bag!

10:42.470 --> 10:43.500
Got it!

10:47.440 --> 10:49.140
There's a sniper.

10:52.050 --> 10:53.310
Where is it?

11:00.060 --> 11:02.550
Teacher! I knew it...

11:03.090 --> 11:05.460
Gusto, be a decoy and run!

11:05.460 --> 11:08.490
Are you kidding?
I'm gonna get shot if I do that!

11:09.460 --> 11:10.670
Go or sleep.

11:10.670 --> 11:12.760
You're insane!

11:13.040 --> 11:14.060
There it is.

11:22.540 --> 11:25.280
My, you're pretty good,
Miss Sumeragi.

11:25.810 --> 11:27.250
Ms. Risako...

11:30.990 --> 11:32.980
I won't hand over Karen!

11:33.290 --> 11:35.850
No, you will hand her over.

11:37.630 --> 11:38.760
How unfair!

11:38.760 --> 11:41.330
It's a surprise party from me.

11:41.330 --> 11:42.560
Of a sort...

11:42.970 --> 11:45.730
Karen and Gusto, back me up!

11:45.730 --> 11:49.570
Back you up? How?
We don't have any guns!

11:49.570 --> 11:51.910
Figure it out with your intelligence and courage!

11:51.910 --> 11:52.940
Leave it up to me.

11:52.940 --> 11:53.870
Huh?

11:56.480 --> 11:58.610
Anything's fine. Counting on you!

11:58.610 --> 12:00.610
My, what a reckless kid.

12:23.740 --> 12:24.900
Four more.

12:36.180 --> 12:37.580
You...

12:44.060 --> 12:45.290
What?

12:49.100 --> 12:51.730
Wait!

12:55.400 --> 12:57.700
Why are you aiming at me?

13:13.290 --> 13:15.310
Karen, nice job!

13:49.260 --> 13:50.660
That looks like it hurts!

13:50.660 --> 13:52.560
It slipped out.

13:54.030 --> 13:56.790
Karen, nice shot.

13:57.500 --> 13:59.130
Then the rest are...

13:59.940 --> 14:02.370
Huh? Where's the teacher?

14:03.000 --> 14:05.210
Yeah, she's not here.

14:05.210 --> 14:07.110
Oh, did you mean me?

14:11.280 --> 14:12.340
When did she...

14:16.590 --> 14:18.990
I'll be your oppon...

14:18.990 --> 14:21.860
It's none of your business. Move.

14:21.860 --> 14:23.060
Okay.

14:22.490 --> 14:23.590
That was quick.

14:23.060 --> 14:25.320
Come here, Karen.

14:28.360 --> 14:31.600
Miss Sumeragi, even if you are a Salvager,

14:31.600 --> 14:34.170
you don't have to uncover everything.

14:34.170 --> 14:35.670
What do you mean?

14:35.670 --> 14:37.240
A mystery is a mystery.

14:37.240 --> 14:41.270
There are times when it is better to leave a secret a secret.

14:41.810 --> 14:44.350
Uncovering something won't always make you happy.

14:44.350 --> 14:45.710
What?

14:45.710 --> 14:47.950
I'm sure I don't follow.

14:49.080 --> 14:51.710
You really are a stupid girl!

14:52.890 --> 14:55.360
Excuse me for being dumb!

15:00.130 --> 15:02.390
Where is this?

15:16.810 --> 15:21.340
That's right. You only wiped the windows on the north side, right?

15:22.050 --> 15:26.660
Just doing the north side was plenty!

15:26.660 --> 15:29.120
Didn't I tell you to do all of them?!

15:30.030 --> 15:33.860
It's impossible to do all of them myself!

15:33.860 --> 15:36.300
Making you do the impossible is what makes it punishment.

15:36.300 --> 15:40.630
That's too harsh a punishment for being late!

15:44.610 --> 15:46.600
Hey, are you okay?

16:19.070 --> 16:21.410
Isn't that enough, Miss Sumeragi?

16:21.410 --> 16:23.550
It's about time to wrap this up.

16:23.550 --> 16:24.770
Good night.

16:27.950 --> 16:28.970
Hey!

16:31.750 --> 16:32.980
Karen!

16:35.620 --> 16:36.890
What are you doing?

17:07.690 --> 17:11.830
I gave up already, so you don't have to tie me up.

17:11.830 --> 17:16.460
My, who was it that taught me not to trust others?

17:16.460 --> 17:19.700
Okay, fine, I'll quietly do as you say.

17:19.700 --> 17:22.870
Then let's have you disclose everything.

17:22.870 --> 17:26.070
Oh, you need to excuse me from that.

17:26.070 --> 17:28.640
We do have our circumstances.

17:28.640 --> 17:30.280
That's not gonna work.

17:30.280 --> 17:32.650
Goodness, how scary.

17:32.650 --> 17:34.580
Why don't you answer seriously?

17:35.320 --> 17:37.890
Who asked you to do this?
What's their motive?

17:37.890 --> 17:40.760
Don't worry about it. Just go home.

17:40.760 --> 17:42.380
Talking like you're all that...

17:43.430 --> 17:45.590
Our entire conversation is being overheard.

17:45.590 --> 17:48.000
The next agent will be coming right away.

17:48.000 --> 17:49.160
What was that?

17:49.730 --> 17:52.000
Your adventure game is over.

17:53.440 --> 17:54.840
What is it, Karen?

18:01.340 --> 18:02.380
That's extreme.

18:02.380 --> 18:03.610
Karen...

18:03.610 --> 18:05.380
Revenge for yesterday.

18:20.030 --> 18:21.890
It's too cold-blooded!

18:22.530 --> 18:24.970
I'm gonna go tell the captain!

18:27.200 --> 18:28.440
What is that?

18:28.440 --> 18:29.770
A transmitter.

18:35.010 --> 18:36.380
You can hear me, right?

18:37.150 --> 18:38.270
It's you, right?

18:39.310 --> 18:43.880
I can remember the past.
And you too.

18:44.390 --> 18:46.080
But not all of it.

18:46.520 --> 18:48.960
I want to know about the time that disappeared.

18:48.960 --> 18:50.990
I want to know my true self.

18:50.990 --> 18:55.520
I'm going to decide my future on my own, so don't interfere.

18:57.200 --> 18:58.330
Please.

19:09.010 --> 19:12.170
I'm sorry, but please stick with me a little longer.

19:17.990 --> 19:21.050
I'm sure the answer is deep in the sea.

19:21.620 --> 19:22.590
I'm sure...

19:27.900 --> 19:29.760
Not this again.

19:29.760 --> 19:31.430
Just shut up and do it.

19:31.430 --> 19:32.460
Okay...

19:39.770 --> 19:41.380
Well then...

19:41.380 --> 19:44.970
Your father will stop us if he hears the news,

19:45.510 --> 19:47.050
but it's pointless, right, Miss?

19:47.050 --> 19:49.820
Of course. This is where the real thing starts.

19:49.820 --> 19:51.550
I knew it.

19:51.550 --> 19:54.090
It'd be hard on the club members, so I'll leave them behind.

19:54.090 --> 19:55.360
Please take care of the rest.

19:55.360 --> 19:56.490
Okay, okay.

19:56.490 --> 19:59.790
We threw the ladies we caught into the hold,

19:59.790 --> 20:01.360
so you can do what you like with them.

20:01.360 --> 20:02.630
Now see here...

20:03.700 --> 20:06.230
The submarine is ready. It's okay!

20:06.230 --> 20:07.640
All right!

20:07.640 --> 20:09.770
Let's go on with the thrilling

20:09.770 --> 20:14.470
and exciting underwater adventure full of mysteries!

20:15.940 --> 20:17.210
She's crazy.

20:17.210 --> 20:20.780
And there you have it, so get prepared, Miss Salvager.

20:20.780 --> 20:22.010
Roger.

20:22.850 --> 20:24.750
I'm leaving the lady up to you.

20:26.050 --> 20:27.020
Okay!

20:31.260 --> 20:32.520
I'll leave the food he...

20:33.860 --> 20:34.760
What?

20:34.760 --> 20:36.630
It's the food.

20:36.630 --> 20:39.230
And we can totally see.

20:41.140 --> 20:42.670
Look over there!

20:42.670 --> 20:43.870
Yes, ma'am!

20:43.870 --> 20:45.670
If you look at mine, I'll kill you.

20:46.880 --> 20:48.740
Who wants to see that?

20:50.010 --> 20:51.240
Hey, are you okay?

20:52.150 --> 20:53.550
It's nothing.

20:54.880 --> 20:56.150
What are you looking at?

20:56.150 --> 20:57.820
I didn't mean to!

20:57.820 --> 20:59.050
So full of energy.

20:59.390 --> 21:01.620
Gosh, nowadays kids are...

21:01.620 --> 21:02.490
Don't!

21:03.490 --> 21:05.290
Your hair is touching the hatch.

21:05.290 --> 21:06.630
Who cares?

21:06.630 --> 21:07.860
What are you saying?

21:07.860 --> 21:10.400
Even one hair getting stuck is enough to cause a leak.

21:10.400 --> 21:11.670
Don't yell.

21:11.670 --> 21:13.970
Of course I'll yell!
Our lives are on the line.

21:15.570 --> 21:17.510
People are waiting.

21:17.510 --> 21:19.540
Submarine, begin descent.

21:19.540 --> 21:20.840
Beginning descent.

22:03.180 --> 22:05.190
Good morning to those in Japan.

22:05.190 --> 22:08.590
I am Eri Shinkai, the treasure hunter!

22:08.590 --> 22:12.830
We are here in the southern seas, investigating a mystery!

22:12.830 --> 22:14.820
What the heck is she doing?

22:19.800 --> 22:22.240
Finding out about the past

22:22.240 --> 22:28.180
will only hurt the precious people who are with you now.

22:28.680 --> 22:31.670
And you as well...

23:12.890 --> 23:20.920
I swear to that dream that
I will protect you, rise

23:24.630 --> 23:34.630
No one waits at the farthest end of someone else's dream

23:36.480 --> 23:46.480
I wished for feelings to be carried and flown up high into the sky

23:48.190 --> 23:53.930
I was endlessly struggling and miserably in pain

23:53.930 --> 24:01.440
So I tightly gripped my weakness in my hands

24:01.440 --> 24:11.440
I swear I'll send you the hopes that melt the sadness, rise

24:13.210 --> 24:22.920
I'll head to tomorrow by holding onto niceness and strength

24:22.920 --> 24:28.830
And I'll swear, rise

24:30.900 --> 24:37.000
I'll swear to tomorrow, rise

24:47.550 --> 24:48.820
The next episode is...

24:48.320 --> 24:49.220
Oh yeah, Eri.

24:49.220 --> 24:51.050
Give me back the money I lent you yesterday for the juice.

24:51.050 --> 24:52.420
I'm in pain.

24:51.720 --> 24:52.720
Hey, hey.

24:52.720 --> 24:54.190
My memories are rushing by.

24:54.190 --> 24:55.260
Pay me back.

24:54.920 --> 24:56.190
Oh, they are here for me.

24:55.960 --> 24:57.290
Pay me back for the juice, then die.

24:57.290 --> 24:58.360
Demon!

24:57.860 --> 25:00.060
In the next episode, Eri will (beep).

25:00.060 --> 25:01.330
(beep)?

25:00.360 --> 25:01.330
Oh well.

25:01.530 --> 25:06.370
Deep Blue Girl

25:01.530 --> 25:06.370
Look forward to the next episode!
